s particularly miserable, finally to lodgings built from mud brick along the north wall of the Dar al-Makhzen. They were able to organise themselves a little there, to build themselves a church, to have chapels, a convent and infirmaries.”'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 909, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 845})
